---
component: eventOpens
# A festival's opening announcement: once per window of its season, on the
# first daily reset the window is live, and it opens the festival's banner.
params:
  season: string
  live: string
  banner: { type: { domain: banner } }
beat:
  on: dailyReset
  once: "season:@season"
  priority: "10"
  when: "@live"
---

## Opening

::body
::openBanner{banner=@banner}
